{"unit_id":"lakabuji-arch__dsh-model-accordion#card-zh","repo":"lakabuji-arch/dsh-model-accordion","commit":"e417fab5b186f34bb56fa822208f39d97640a178","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-accordion 是面向 DSH Web composer 的模型选择器插件。它把原有模型入口替换为按 provider 折叠的列表，并通过 DSH model directory 读取和提交选择。用户可搜索模型名称、ID 或描述，展开供应商分组，选择模型与可用的 reasoning effort；努力等级优先采用目录中配置的选项，缺省时再使用内置表。菜单支持键盘导航、状态提示和主题 token。适合需要在 Web 对话中浏览多供应商模型并调整推理等级的用户；需要 DSH Web 配置好模型目录服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:126-165","lib/client.js:377-394"]}
{"unit_id":"lakabuji-arch__dsh-model-accordion#card-en","repo":"lakabuji-arch/dsh-model-accordion","commit":"e417fab5b186f34bb56fa822208f39d97640a178","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-accordion adds a searchable, provider-folded model picker to the DSH Web composer. It reads the shared model directory and supports catalog or built-in reasoning effort choices. Keyboard navigation and theme tokens are included. Requires the DSH Web model-directory service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:126-165","lib/client.js:377-394"]}
